        "A non-blocking gzwrite on a valid gzFile must stall while stale external input pointers remain.",
        "A later gzprintf or gzvprintf call must operate on that same gzip state after the stall.",
        "The call path must supply a valid zlib ABI context and formatted arguments; a raw zlib symbol invoked as a PostgreSQL version-1 C function does not match Datum funcname(PG_FUNCTION_ARGS). An ABI-compatible installed or later-loaded wrapper has not been ruled out.",
